    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A strategy-driven FPS where you solve puzzles, explore vast and confined areas, and exterminate malicious creatures alongside your robot companion.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and wreak havoc on diverse, old-school-style maps\u2014each presenting its own unique challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your resources carefully; you can never have enough ammo. Master a blood-based energy system: dominating enemies grants you power to swing a giant sword, repair your robot friend, and wield powerful weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your companion\u2019s abilities too\u2014you can directly control some, and use positive reinforcement to condition others. Your sentry\u2019s fighting style evolves based on your choices!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your progress anytime with an old-school style save system.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A strategy-driven FPS where you solve puzzles, explore vast and confined areas, and exterminate malicious creatures alongside your robot companion.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and wreak havoc on diverse, old-school-style maps\u2014each presenting its own unique challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your resources carefully; you can never have enough ammo. Master a blood-based energy system: dominating enemies grants you power to swing a giant sword, repair your robot friend, and wield powerful weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your companion\u2019s abilities too\u2014you can directly control some, and use positive reinforcement to condition others. Your sentry\u2019s fighting style evolves based on your choices!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your progress anytime with an old-school style save system.</p>",
    "short_description": "A strategy-driven FPS where you solve puzzles, explore vast and confined areas, and exterminate malicious creatures alongside your robot companion. Fend off monsters in large arenas with your battle machine \u2014 and be ready to survive on your own!",
